[["heading","FULL-STACK SOFTWARE ENGINEERING INTERNSHIP • 21 / 34\nSQL & Relational\nDatabases"],["heading","Complete Visual Teaching Edition"],["sinhala","","SQL සහ relational databases මුල සිට interview level දක්වා පියවJරෙන් පියවරෙ ඉJගෙන ගෙමු.",435],["heading","30"],["heading","Original topics\n20"],["heading","Additional topics\n50"],["text","Lessons"],["heading","How to study"],["text","Read the English definition, then the Sinhala explanation. Follow the diagram, run the example in a\ndisposable database, answer the interview question aloud and attempt the exercise."],["heading","Dialect and examples"],["text","MySQL 8.0+ (InnoDB) is the main reference dialect. Some examples require 8.0.16+ for enforced CHECK\nconstraints. Individual snippets are independent, not a single migration script. Use the practice database\nat the end for core query exercises; specialized examples may need additional tables or privileges."],["sinhala","","Production database එකක DELETE, DROP, TRUNCATE Jහහෝ ALTER examples run කරෙන්න එපා. Practice",493],["sinhala","","database එකක් භාවිත කරෙන්න.",156],["heading","Scope"],["text","Original checklist Section 21 topics 1–30; previous study guide additions 31–37; new interview-focused\ntopics 38–50. Static diagrams are explanatory, not screenshots from a running database."]]